  "blocks": {
    "text-1": {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本讲默认只展示 live 代码，不在构建时启动容器、连接远端内核或申请 GPU。点击运行前，先准备相应环境；下面的条件是真实前提。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "普通 JavaScript / Python 见“代码、引用与运行”。这里的 Docker、WASI、WebGPU 和 Jupyter 各有独立边界，不保证每台电脑都具备。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "environment-check": {
      "id": "environment-check",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "shell",
      "value": "presmium check guide-environments --env\n# 环境不足时查看实际诊断，不把预录结果当作运行成功。\n# 网页可显式缓存 WASI 等运行资源；离线按钮会显示实际下载大小。"
    },
    "text-4": {
      "id": "text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "此组件使用本讲的 .devcontainer 定义。运行需要本机 Docker 服务及镜像，首次构建可能需要下载；本示例验证不会自动拉取镜像。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“导出环境”把实际定义和当前代码打包，便于用同一环境复现。代码只保存在 child code block，组件参数不再重复保存源码。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "container-source": {
      "id": "container-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "import platform\nprint(platform.python_version())\nprint(\"容器中的计算：\", sum(range(1, 6)))",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.container"
      }
    },
    "container-panel": {
      "id": "container-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "container-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "file": "hello.py"
      },
      "children": [
        "container-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-7": {
      "id": "text-7",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这些代码使用真实 WASI 运行时，网页构建需包含对应运行资源。它们不等于可以访问任意本机文件的原生程序。缺少运行资源时应明确报告不可用。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "wasi-c": {
      "id": "wasi-c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "c",
      "value": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) { printf(\"C: %d\\n\", 6 * 7); return 0; }",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.wasi"
      }
    },
    "wasi-cpp": {
      "id": "wasi-cpp",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": "#include <iostream>\nint main() { std::cout << \"C++: \" << 6 * 7 << std::endl; }",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.wasi"
      }
    },
    "wasi-ruby": {
      "id": "wasi-ruby",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "ruby",
      "value": "puts \"Ruby: #{6 * 7}\"",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.wasi"
      }
    },
    "wasi-sql": {
      "id": "wasi-sql",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "value": "SELECT 6 * 7 AS answer;",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.wasi"
      }
    },
    "gpu-source": {
      "id": "gpu-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "wgsl",
      "value": "@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> a: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> b: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> out: array<f32>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) id: vec3<u32>) {\n if (id.x < arrayLength(&out)) { out[id.x] = a[id.x] + b[id.x]; }\n}",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.webgpu",
        "args": {
          "buffers": "{\"a\":[1,2,3,4],\"b\":[10,20,30,40],\"out\":{\"size\":4}}",
          "dispatch": "1",
          "repeat": "1"
        }
      }
    },
    "gpu-panel": {
      "id": "gpu-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "gpu-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "params": {
          "buffers": {
            "a": [
              1,
              2,
              3,
              4
            ],
            "b": [
              10,
              20,
              30,
              40
            ],
            "out": {
              "size": 4
            }
          },
          "dispatch": 1,
          "repeat": 1
        }
      },
      "children": [
        "gpu-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-9": {
      "id": "text-9",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "需要安全上下文、支持 WebGPU 的浏览器和可用适配器。面板报告实际执行器与错误；软件适配器和硬件 GPU 的性能不同。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "jax-source": {
      "id": "jax-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "value": "import { defaultDevice, init, numpy as np } from '@jax-js/jax'\nconst devices = await init()\nif (devices.includes('webgpu')) defaultDevice('webgpu')\nconst product = np.matmul(np.array([[1,2],[3,4]]), np.array([[5,6],[7,8]]))\nconsole.log(defaultDevice(), JSON.stringify(await product.jsAsync()))",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live"
      }
    },
    "text-11": {
      "id": "text-11",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "输出中的设备名来自实际运行。没有 WebGPU 时，不能把其它后端的结果标成 GPU 加速。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "bridge-source": {
      "id": "bridge-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "import presmium_gpu as gpu\nSHADER = \"@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> a: array<f32>;\\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> b: array<f32>;\\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> out: array<f32>;\\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) id: vec3<u32>) {\\n if (id.x < arrayLength(&out)) { out[id.x] = a[id.x] + b[id.x]; }\\n}\"\nresult = await gpu.run(SHADER, buffers={\"a\":[1,2,3,4],\"b\":[10,20,30,40],\"out\":{\"size\":4}})\nprint(result)\nprint(\"同步桥接可用：\", gpu.can_run_sync())",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live"
      }
    },
    "text-13": {
      "id": "text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "异步桥接仍需要真实 Pyodide 与 GPU 能力。同步桥接额外需要 JSPI 与 Worker I/O 支持；请依据 can_run_sync() 的实际结果，不默认认为每个浏览器都支持。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "text-15": {
      "id": "text-15",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "lab 使用 proxy 认证：浏览器经实际 Presmium 服务转发到 Jupyter，令牌不写入文稿。运营者在服务进程设置 PRESMIUM_ENV_LAB_URL 与 PRESMIUM_ENV_LAB_TOKEN；未配置或只打开静态网站时，保持真实不可用状态。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "env 认证仅用于构建时执行；prompt 由读者在浏览器输入自己的凭据；none 只适用于可信的无认证服务。hub 目前只是保留契约，尚不能连接 JupyterHub，不能当成已实现功能。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "jupyter-define": {
      "id": "jupyter-define",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "title": "1. 定义远端变量",
      "value": "import platform\nanswer = 41\nprint(\"远端内核：\", platform.python_implementation())",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.env.lab",
        "session": "feature-remote"
      }
    },
    "jupyter-use": {
      "id": "jupyter-use",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "title": "2. 在同一会话使用",
      "value": "print(answer + 1)",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "executor": "presmium.env.lab",
        "session": "feature-remote"
      }
    },
    "terminal-widget": {
      "id": "terminal-widget",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "terminal-widget-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "env": "lab",
        "rows": 10
      }
    },
    "text-18": {
      "id": "text-18",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "只有点击连接且服务能力允许才打开终端。取消或离开后释放连接与资源。终端中的命令实际运行在远端环境，先确认目标再执行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
